      "text": "INSPECTION OF TRANSMISSION COMPONENTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "1. INSPECT OUTPUT SHAFT AND INNER RACE"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Hands using calipers to measure the output shaft flange thickness",
      "labels": [
        "WM0004"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 5,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 37,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(a) Using calipers, measure the output shaft flange thickness."
    },
    {
      "type": "specification",
      "label": "Minimum thickness:",
      "value": "5.60 mm (0.2205 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Hands using calipers to measure the inner race flange thickness",
      "labels": [
        "WM0057"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 24,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 37,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(b) Using calipers, measure the inner race flange thickness."
    },
    {
      "type": "specification",
      "label": "Minimum thickness:",
      "value": "4.70 mm (0.1850 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Hands using a micrometer to measure the outer diameter of the output shaft journal",
      "labels": [
        "WM0005"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 43,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 37,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(c) Using a micrometer, measure the outer diameter of the output shaft journal."
    },
    {
      "type": "specification",
      "label": "Minimum diameter:",
      "items": [
        "2nd gear  42.85 mm (1.6870 in.)",
        "3rd gear  37.80 mm (1.4882 in.)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Hands using a micrometer to measure the outer diameter of the inner race",
      "labels": [
        "WM0059"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 62,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 37,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(d) Using a micrometer, measure the outer diameter of the inner race."
    },
    {
      "type": "specification",
      "label": "Minimum diameter:",
      "value": "42.85 mm (1.6870 in.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Dial indicator mounted on stands checking shaft runout with shaft supported on V-blocks",
      "labels": [
        "WM0061"
